    "title": "Iowa State Defeats Baylor, Extends Winning Streak",
    "text": "• No. 3 Iowa State defeated Baylor 70-60.\n• Iowa State's record is now 15-0 (2-0 in the Big 12).\n• Iowa State has won 15 consecutive games, a school record.\n• Joshua Jefferson scored 19 points and had 17 rebounds for Iowa State.\n• Tamin Lipsey scored 24 points for Iowa State.\n• Killyan Toure scored 12 points for Iowa State.\n• Baylor's record is now 10-4 (0-2 in the Big 12).\n• Cameron Carr scored 17 points for Baylor.\n• James Nnaji, a 2023 NBA draft pick for Baylor, scored 2 points in his home debut.\n• Iowa State will host Oklahoma State on Saturday.\n• Baylor will host No. 7 Houston on Saturday.",
